data: {"id": "44af61a131f54d28-thinking-parallel_evidence-1243", "run_id": "44af61a131f54d28", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 生命周期 (Metrics)**\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1，labels: `reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"`\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_phase` = Pending (1), Running/Failed/Succeeded/Unknown 均为 0\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0\n   - **结论**: Pod 仍卡在 Pending，container `app` 处于 CreateContainerConfigError，未发生重启。\n\n2. **Pod Describe 事件**\n   - 事件: `Warning Failed 21m (x12 over 23m) kubelet Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788774997103, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

