data: {"id": "44af61a131f54d28-final", "run_id": "44af61a131f54d28", "seq": 1248, "ts_ms": 1788775013171, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p 处于 Pending 状态，Container 处于 CreateContainerConfigError，无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet (fact-8ff15971a44a) | `Warning Failed ... Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | **直接证明**：Kubelet 因 Secret 缺 Key 导致注入配置失败，是状态异常的起因 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubelet (fact-a801c88bdbc8) | Pod 状态: `Pending` | 表现现象：因配置错误导致 Pod 无法进入运行态 |\n| 3 | Metric | Prometheus (fact-e2b92c3fdf76) | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1，Label: `reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"` | 独立验证：集群指标显示容器处于配置错误等待状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus (fact-3dfd9d5c5c52) | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 0 | 排除干扰：容器因配置阶段失败从未启动，故不存在重启行为 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nK8s Event (1) 给出了容器无法启动的精确错误原因（Secret key 缺失），Metric (3) 在集群层面独立验证了该状态码为 `CreateContainerConfigError`。两者因果与现象高度一致，共同排除了网络或调度等其他故障可能。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nSecret aiops-case-04/workload-input 缺失 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 注入配置失败 → 容器状态变为 CreateContainerConfigError → Pod 卡死在 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` 引用的 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中缺少其 Spec 中指定的 key `'unavailable-key'`。\n- 这一配置错误导致 `kubelet` 在尝试挂载/注入环境变量或卷时失败（证据 1）。\n- 直接引发容器进入 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态（证据 3），从而使 Pod 保持 `Pending` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 554.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p: 554.2s (Evidence 546.0s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 578.244, "metrics": {"run_id": "44af61a131f54d28", "mttr": {"value": "9.6m", "seconds": 578.2516901493073, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 578251.6901493073, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 574383.4400177002, "tool_calls": 8, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 8, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 8632.31611251831, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3517.25697517395}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16223.889827728271, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 554206.4607143402, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", 